        "title": "National Roundtable on the American Dream",
        "description": "Join a candid discussion about how Americans are thinking about opportunity, security, success, retirement, and the future they hope to build. In small groups of 4-6 people, you\u2019ll talk directly with people from different backgrounds hearing how they are pursuing their goals, navigating challenges, and making important decisions.\n\nYour conversations will help build a report on this topic; see recent Roundtable Reports at  <a href=\"https://www.allsides.com/dialogue#research-reports\">allsides.com/dialogue</a> \n\nHave questions? Send them to <a href=\"mailto:feedback@allsides.com?subject=Roundtables%20Feedback\">feedback@allsides.com</a>. We'd love to hear from you.\n\nRead our full Privacy Notice at <a href=\"https://www.allsides.com/privacy\">allsides.com/privacy</a>.\n\n<i>This event's conversation guide was developed by AllSides, adapted from Living Room Conversations' model with input from Nationwide Insurance.</i>",
