        "postEventCardData": {
          "headline": "We hope you enjoyed the event!",
          "message": "Please fill out our <strong>post-event sentiment survey below</strong> to let us know how your perspective may have changed.\n\nAs a thank you, we would like to offer you an AllSides Sustaining Membership FREE for six months. New members can use the code AMERICANDREAM26 at checkout.\n\nIf you are already a paying AllSides Sustaining Member, your discount will be automatically applied. Monthly members will receive the next six months free. Yearly members will get 50% off the next year. Billing will resume automatically. You can view and update your membership at any time at <a href=\"http://allsides.com/user/account\">allsides.com/user/account</a>. Email <a href=\"admin@allsides.com\">admin@allsides.com</a> with any questions.",
          "type": "postEvent",
          "surveyQuestions": [
            {
              "id": "f718cf5b-30bd-4cb4-aa23-24dc5a2d1050",
              "type": "multipleChoice",
              "title": "Thinking about your own life, do you believe\u2026",
              "options": [
                {
                  "id": "2513325e-0967-4b28-b8b1-bf5ca77f5859",
                  "text": "I\u2019ve achieved the American Dream."
                },
                {
                  "id": "56f8f700-f782-48d3-a27a-c5ffb9385cb0",
                  "text": "I\u2019m on my way to achieving the American Dream."
                },
                {
                  "id": "5822f7e0-9c4c-4227-ac10-af0a31c0f174",
                  "text": "The American Dream is out of reach for me."
                },
                {
                  "id": "b5c92135-c5c7-4220-b830-2146e314d20e",
                  "text": "Unsure"
                }
              ],
              "statements": []
            },
            {
              "id": "f8d10a38-0f31-41fd-8e63-07cae0277734",
              "type": "multipleChoice",
              "title": "For you and your family, is the American Dream more about\u2026",
              "options": [
                {
                  "id": "5207844b-b998-4406-b88a-0ff077a52d86",
                  "text": "Being able to support your family with a job and safe place to live"
                },
                {
                  "id": "2a0c3556-de0d-4693-a8c7-e31fb5653a9c",
                  "text": "Being able to improve the quality of life for you and your family through education, better job opportunities and other resources"
                },
                {
                  "id": "3ffc103f-9db1-4791-b44f-29338e38c753",
                  "text": "Unsure"
                }
              ],
              "statements": []
            },
            {
              "id": "fe03c8e3-6547-402a-a2a1-2147eaf8c2eb",
              "type": "agreeDisagree",
              "title": "",
              "options": [],
              "statements": [
                {
                  "id": "aec12633-dc82-4afc-861e-e1f990920f8c",
                  "text": "I accept that my beliefs may be wrong."
                },
                {
                  "id": "c3082345-588d-48a3-8d60-10b86ad68cb8",
                  "text": "I respect others' opinions even when I do not agree."
                },
                {
                  "id": "227b61ba-3718-4c69-9c90-9f40c62667bb",
                  "text": "I felt I could express my views openly in this conversation."
                },
                {
                  "id": "c42bd9cf-0c6e-4e1b-b946-6b2918b99026",
                  "text": "There was a moment in this conversation where I questioned something I previously believed about finances or the American Dream."
                },
                {
                  "id": "96fd39fc-c426-45e2-8023-9516cfae0aa3",
                  "text": "After hearing others' stories, I better understand why people with different financial backgrounds see the American Dream differently."
                },
                {
                  "id": "1266789e-5568-4224-80c2-0f9530ea26fc",
                  "text": "I met people or perspectives I would not normally encounter."
                },
                {
                  "id": "cdb7f036-0aad-4ab6-8a46-768539928155",
                  "text": "I felt respected by others in the group."
                },
                {
                  "id": "3de62401-2aed-40d9-ab51-cbb9470f7e7d",
                  "text": "Right now, protecting what I have matters more to me than growing my wealth."
                },
                {
                  "id": "8b2b7c6e-e464-49d7-8c8d-7832bc47f4c3",
                  "text": "I know what steps to take to build financial security."
                },
                {
                  "id": "62dd9f83-5092-4ed3-858b-e4001aeeda05",
                  "text": "I wish I had more guidance from a financial advisor to help me build financial security."
                },
                {
                  "id": "b240e9f8-569d-480e-ad5e-8fc0a3210087",
                  "text": "The American Dream can be achieved by people like me."
                },
                {
                  "id": "41c21c03-1c50-486f-8741-eb6bb91ffced",
                  "text": "There's a point in modern American life where building financial security matters more than taking risks to get ahead."
                },
                {
                  "id": "b71ee192-14cd-48bd-a4b8-f7d694f70adf",
                  "text": "I can achieve a better life than my parents\u2019 generation."
                },
                {
                  "id": "209c4224-6de1-41d1-a8fb-68be042b4f22",
                  "text": "Financial security is determined more by financial habits and decisions than by income level."
                },
                {
                  "id": "60805d43-d325-43dc-ab5e-56a935385412",
                  "text": "It is important that people strive for the American Dream"
                },
                {
                  "id": "9804d485-6ef1-4f56-88c6-f8bc7236df2e",
                  "text": "Financial risk is necessary to achieve the American Dream."
                }
              ]
            },
